{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject invalid exporter configuration at build time**\n\nThis builds successfully with a null/blank bucket or a non-positive record limit. The first export then fails inside the AWS request and the plugin catches it, leaving the workflow successful but producing no insight records. Validate required destination fields and documented positive limits before creating the client, with equivalent validation for the CloudWatch Logs builder and unit tests for invalid configurations.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obJ-_","finding_digest":"e8a5b44aec088cacad74b5c8f27217af254f94633bd01809b417ffe58546b79c","finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"8f43d10a6dda0fd688c409e8a2696e92a5ff15e4396a80738512bd625b0133c1","observation_id":"aro_v1_r5b5cctn3ih5ncgebhuke2losk","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/S3Exporter.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tayk6qge2h3e74wst5kjjjd6wi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"24e28b812198c4b065174ba4b7f7600305deb4ae","reviewer":"codex","start_line":135,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_avctjrq4z6vwh42cgygphenflh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
